WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.675
A recursive CTE has two parts The anchor term starts

00:00:05.701 --> 00:00:11.269
the result The recursive term refers to the CTE and
finds the

00:00:11.282 --> 00:00:17.567
next level UNION ALL combines the rows The

00:00:17.594 --> 00:00:23.833
process continues until the recursive term produces
no more matching rows This

00:00:23.859 --> 00:00:26.938
is useful for hierarchies and parent-child
structures
